{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-03-10 04:00:00', 'title': 'EGYPTAIR TOURISM AND DUTY FREE CO. LANDS CLOUD CONTRACT WITH IBM', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., MARCH 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE: IBM) AND\xa0EGYPTAIR TOURISM AND DUTY FREE CO. ANNOUNCED TODAY A NEW AGREEMENT IN WHICH THE AIRLINE WILL LEVERAGE IBM CLOUD TO SCALE AND MODERNIZE EGYPTAIR DUTY FREE BACK-END OPERATIONS AND HOST ITS SAP TRAVEL RETAIL SYSTEM.'}